{
    "title": "Make Money: Play & Earn Cash",
    "description": "Make Money: Play & Earn Cash\r\n\r\nMake Money & Earn Cash Rewards - Get Paid to Play Music & Games\r\n\r\nThe Mode Earn App is your #1 rewards app for earning extra cash, with over $325,000,000 earned & saved by users, and counting!\r\n\r\nGet started earning cash and making extra money by playing games, reading the news, listening to music, and more! Redeem your earned rewards in cash or gift cards! The Mode Earn App allows you to earn real cash rewards simply for doing everyday mobile activities.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 EARN MONEY & free gift cards in minutes.\r\n\ud83c\udfae MAKE MONEY playing games, music, shopping, & even charging.\r\n\ud83d\udcf1\ud83d\udcb3 MAKE MONEY from your phone & get paid in gift cards on the Mode Earn App!\r\n\ud83d\udcb8\ud83d\udcf1\ud83c\udfae EARN CASH! The only cash app that pays you REAL MONEY by playing games!\r\n\r\nLooking for the perfect side hustle? A new way to make money on your phone? The Mode Earn App is the most versatile real cash rewards app on the market. Other rewards apps limit you to just games, or only surveys. The Mode Earn App offers you the most diverse earning opportunities, from games, surveys, news music, offers, and more, allowing you to monetize your time most effectively. You\u2019re even getting paid to listen to a selection of 100,000+ radio stations with the world\u2019s top songs, and play new games from the world\u2019s top game studios! You can make money daily with this app \u2013 it\u2019s easy.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa7\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcf1 Make money by listening to free music on the Mode Earn App!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcac\ud83d\udccb Get paid cash to give us your opinions through surveys on the Mode Earn App!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udcf1 Earn cash rewards by trying free games, apps, & watching short videos!\r\n\ud83c\udf81\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb8 Invite friends to the Mode Earn App and earn gift cards, money, and cash!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83c\udfb5\ud83d\udd12 Make money for having the Mode Earn App free music player on your lock screen!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udecd\ud83d\udcb8 Get paid cash instantly for shopping and save money with the Mode Earn App!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udf0e Get paid to play games from the best game studios in the world on the Mode Earn App!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udd0c Make money by charging your phone \u2013 we make earning cash that simple!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb0 Make money bonuses on the Mode Earn App!\r\n\r\nThe Mode Earn App is here! The first music platform that rewards you with cash! The Mode Earn App includes a music lock screen that provides users with a free music streaming experience with built-in money-making reward opportunities to cash in on their daily habits.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Earn money for just streaming music!\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Cash out quickly! Real money & rewards!\r\n\ud83d\udcb8 FREE to use! No fees. Just Earning!\r\n\ud83c\udd93 Load up on rewards! & Free listening!\r\n\ud83c\udfae Make money from games! Cash in on your time playing games!\r\n\ud83e\udd11 Make more money for inviting friends! Fast Cash for Top Radio Music player Mixes!\r\n\ud83d\udce5 Download top games & make money!\r\n\r\nOnce you earn enough points through playing games, listening to music, reading the news, and more, simply select cash or gift card rewards and cash out! It\u2019s that simple. We\u2019ve proudly been paying out real cash rewards to our users daily, for years!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make Money: Play &amp; Earn Cash<br><br>Make Money &amp; Earn Cash Rewards - Get Paid to Play Music &amp; Games<br><br>The Mode Earn App is your #1 rewards app for earning extra cash, with over $325,000,000 earned &amp; saved by users, and counting!<br><br>Get started earning cash and making extra money by playing games, reading the news, listening to music, and more! Redeem your earned rewards in cash or gift cards! The Mode Earn App allows you to earn real cash rewards simply for doing everyday mobile activities.<br><br>\ud83d\udcb0 EARN MONEY &amp; free gift cards in minutes.<br>\ud83c\udfae MAKE MONEY playing games, music, shopping, &amp; even charging.<br>\ud83d\udcf1\ud83d\udcb3 MAKE MONEY from your phone &amp; get paid in gift cards on the Mode Earn App!<br>\ud83d\udcb8\ud83d\udcf1\ud83c\udfae EARN CASH! The only cash app that pays you REAL MONEY by playing games!<br><br>Looking for the perfect side hustle? A new way to make money on your phone? The Mode Earn App is the most versatile real cash rewards app on the market. Other rewards apps limit you to just games, or only surveys. The Mode Earn App offers you the most diverse earning opportunities, from games, surveys, news music, offers, and more, allowing you to monetize your time most effectively. You\u2019re even getting paid to listen to a selection of 100,000+ radio stations with the world\u2019s top songs, and play new games from the world\u2019s top game studios! You can make money daily with this app \u2013 it\u2019s easy.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa7\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcf1 Make money by listening to free music on the Mode Earn App!<br>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcac\ud83d\udccb Get paid cash to give us your opinions through surveys on the Mode Earn App!<br>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udcf1 Earn cash rewards by trying free games, apps, &amp; watching short videos!<br>\ud83c\udf81\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcb8 Invite friends to the Mode Earn App and earn gift cards, money, and cash!<br>\ud83d\ud